{"id":"7da44596b6c13df1","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md","title":"Normed Vector Space","display":"df-normed-vector — Normed Vector Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-normed-vector","aliases":["58-df-normed-vector","Normed Vector Space"],"display":"df-normed-vector — Normed Vector Space","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-normed-vector"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-normed-vector</span><span>Normed Vector Space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normed-vector — Normed Vector Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in\\mathbf V\">\\(V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in\\mathbf V\\)</span> (结构参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\)</span> (规范赋范空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S\\subseteq\\mathbf V^5\">\\(\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S\\subseteq\\mathbf V^5\\)</span> (本文件定义的兼容谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}vector}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}vector}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是规范赋范空间谓词的命名适配层；域与两种运算均为显式参数。</li>\n<li>Banach 完备性和“有限维赋范空间完备”分别是后续定义与定理，不属于本文件 assertion。</li>\n<li>Hilbert: inner product gives norm; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"||x|| = \\sqrt{\\langle x,x\\rangle}\">\\(||x|| = \\sqrt{\\langle x,x\\rangle}\\)</span>; parallelogram law</li>\n<li>Dual: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^*\">\\(V^*\\)</span> norm dual is Banach even if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> incomplete; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^*\">\\(V^*\\)</span> always complete</li>\n<li>Completion: every normed space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> has completion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat{V}\">\\(\\hat{V}\\)</span> unique up to isometry</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S$ (规范赋范空间谓词, see [[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S\\subseteq\\mathbf V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}vector}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(V,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":true},{"tex":"||x|| = \\sqrt{\\langle x,x\\rangle}","display":false},{"tex":"V^*","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V^*","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat{V}","display":false}],"bytes":1313,"backlinks":[{"id":"261de7e0269cd7e2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)$ 与 $\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)$（see [[../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md]]）"},{"id":"e21bed5fcec14186","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ (赋范空间, see [[58-df-normed-vector]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-normed-vector]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-889","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md|58-df-normed-vector]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["bdbbe5a00af04978"]}